            "notes": "The deck focuses on controlling the game by disrupting the opponent's plans through a combination of counterspells, hand disruption spells, and removal. It aims to outvalue the opponent with card advantage engines like Jace, Wielder of Mysteries and Tamiyo, Inquisitive Student, while also utilizing powerful cards like Doomsday to set up game-winning combos. Glarb, Calamity's Augur acts as a versatile and resilient commander, able to generate card advantage and provide a win condition by constantly pressuring the opponent's life total. The deck also includes flexible cards like Abrupt Decay and Toxic Deluge to handle a variety of threats, ensuring that it can adapt to different situations and emerge victorious."
